#lem: Nunamnir[1]DN; namen[the office of en-priest]; namnun[magnificence]; šu[hand]; gal[big]; du[perfect]
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. diŋir ki ni₂-ba mu-un-na-gam-e-eš
