#tr.en: He has taken up residence in @wSN{Nibru}, the lofty bond (?) between heaven and earth.
#lem: iri[city]; igi[eye]; ni[fear]; melim[frightening splendor]; huš[reddish]
#etcsl: line-id=14

15. bar-bi diŋir u₁₉-ru-na saŋ nu-ŋa₂-ŋa₂-dam
